<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes have hit a United Nations building and residential areas in Khartoum, killing four people and threatening humanitarian operations, while RSF forces assaulted aid offices in Nyala and a shelter in West Kordofan, causing civilian casualties. The RSF counterintelligence chief, a commander and a group have defected to the Sudanese army in Khartoum, indicating shifting loyalties. Ethiopia offered to host inclusive Sudan peace talks and propose a national unity government, but Sudan rejected the offer and questioned Ethiopia's neutrality. The conflict produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQRnpfNzZZUGVhWjh1NGFCdDJQaTlGTl9RUWdXUHFPcFg4MmNObW9PREtfaGQ3R2lrN2Q1c3RySkc0SUJOSlNVMjNZS3JRWXQ2aE1EM25ZMmlKSVBzWUE2NnBEZW1xMW51QzdzZXRpTVdvX2lkMmJRaDBVUGYxWFN4NFJEMnVZT00wYlhXTnJNRWtDWGZiRm9TSURKa0JFejN3UUhKUEpzd3JWSlY3VVBSN1Nn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFB1dGNvb2dZOFpibUVteUhNZG1QcGNTTkNweTRObzdocEVBUi1qY1hSbllxWk41YWUtdnByWko5eTNXR1ZRcWtOeVV2emtHbTdi?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNZUQzRWVoT05kTlVaWXowTVlBTTBCdG91NjJHWG5kWmlhODFSZjFzQWRxNE1ZNUxkOGMtM1l1SkY3OC11UllCLUV2UExPX0dybG1JUVZXNlZMSE9Dd3ZPdDdvVjFqNUxuem9xejBhUDFlbWFHVWhFRVpZbmhJM3RaOTEzNWticlE0b2t2YXFHb2Y1WDdoRWM4S05FQk4zLWZ0d19UWnc2Ymd4NDdjUlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Operativ Məlumat Mərkəzi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQM2hjbXhBM1hPdElTLTNXWi1LR1Vvb0hGSzY2QnNCZXlDRHVYTmR2WDBaSWxJTXVpY0pyak0zbWd1ZWhsX29kUW